  m_Name: ForestRemembersBreach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::WardBreachDefinition
  displayName: The Forest Remembers
  warningText: Every root in the clearing turns toward the Heart Tree. The forest has not forgotten what was taken from it. This will come again and again, each time harder. Prepare.
  pendingText: The forest remembers us. It will not stop. Stand with me when you are ready.
  startHint: All the forest's anger will come
  wonText: It draws back, as a tide does. The Heart Tree burns bright in the quiet.
  failedText: The ward falls dark. The forest takes its due and withdraws to wait.
